      "content": "The Lens API provides programmatic access to the full corpus of Lens scholarly works and patents using a REST interface. The API supports rich Elasticsearch-style query DSL for searching scholarly publications and global patent records, with cursor-based pagination, sorting, and field projection. Authentication is via a bearer token issued from the Lens user profile.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Lens API Support",
